AI Search Assistant using only OpenAI,



Install OpenAI SDK


pip install openai


Set API Key


export OPENAI_API_KEY="your_api_key"


Check:

echo $OPENAI_API_KEY


Simple OpenAI Search Assistant

.py



from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI()

query = input("Ask a question: ")

response = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="gpt-4o",
    messages=[
        {
            "role": "system",
            "content": "You are a helpful AI assistant."
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": query
        }
    ]
)

print("\nAI Answer:\n")
print(response.choices[0].message.content)


